  "prefLabel": "Mvi 210.06 Written Comments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mvi 210.06 Written Comments. Individuals may submit comments in writing or electronic format to the board on proposed rulemaking actions any time from the time notice has been published until the end of the public comment period as set forth in the notice of rulemaking.\n\nSource. #9043-A, eff 11-29-07; ss by #12123, eff 3-2-17",
